  "title": "分段函数求值",
  "meta": "第2题 · 函数的概念",
  "view": { "xMin": -1.4, "xMax": 3.6, "yMin": -1.8, "yMax": 3.2 },
  "curves": [
    {
      "id": "left",
      "preset": "quadratic",
      "quadratic": { "a": 1, "b": 0, "c": -1 },
      "domain": { "to": 1 },
      "color": "#2457d6",
      "label": "y = x² - 1",
      "labelCorner": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "right",
      "preset": "reciprocal",
      "reciprocal": { "h": 1, "k": 1 },
      "domain": { "from": 1 },
      "color": "#c2413a",
      "label": "y = 1/(x - 1)",
      "labelCorner": "right"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "pieces",
      "title": "看两段解析式",
      "caption": "x ≤ 1 用蓝色抛物线 y = x² - 1，x > 1 用红色曲线 y = 1/(x - 1)。分界是直线 x = 1。求 f(f(3)) 要由内向外，每次先看自变量落在哪一段。",
      "formula": ["f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^{2}-1,& x\\le 1\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{x-1},& x>1\\end{cases}"],
      "draw": true,
      "curves": ["left", "right"],
      "intervals": [
        { "from": -1.4, "to": 1, "tone": "up", "label": "x ≤ 1" },
        { "from": 1, "to": 3.6, "tone": "down", "label": "x > 1" }
      ],
      "markers": [],
      "guides": [{ "x": 1, "label": "分界 x = 1" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "inner",
      "title": "先算 f(3)",
      "caption": "3 > 1，落在红色这一段，不能用 x² - 1。f(3) = 1/(3 - 1) = 1/2。1/2 只是下一次代入的自变量。选项 D 就是停在这一步。若误用左边，3² - 1 = 8，那是选项 A。",
      "formula": ["3>1", "f(3)=\\dfrac{1}{3-1}=\\dfrac{1}{2}"],
      "curve": "right",
      "curves": ["left", "right"],
      "intervals": [
        { "from": -1.4, "to": 1, "tone": "up", "label": "x ≤ 1" },
        { "from": 1, "to": 3.6, "tone": "down", "label": "x > 1" }
      ],
      "markers": [{ "x": 3, "name": "f(3)", "tone": "down" }],
      "guides": [
        { "x": 1, "label": "分界 x = 1" },
        { "y": 0.5, "label": "1/2" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "branch",
      "title": "判断 1/2 落在哪一段",
      "caption": "现在要算 f(1/2)。1/2 ≤ 1，改用蓝色抛物线。右边的 1/(x - 1) 到这里已经不能再用。",
      "formula": ["\\dfrac{1}{2}\\le 1"],
      "curve": "left",
      "curves": ["left", "right"],
      "intervals": [
        { "from": -1.4, "to": 1, "tone": "up", "label": "1/2 在这一段" },
        { "from": 1, "to": 3.6, "tone": "down", "label": "x > 1" }
      ],
      "markers": [],
      "guides": [
        { "x": 1, "label": "分界 x = 1" },
        { "x": 0.5, "label": "x = 1/2" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outer",
      "title": "再代入左边",
      "caption": "用 y = x² - 1。f(1/2) = (1/2)² - 1 = 1/4 - 1 = -3/4。点落在蓝色曲线上，也在直线 y = -3/4 上。",
      "formula": ["f\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}-1=-\\dfrac{3}{4}"],
      "curve": "left",
      "curves": ["left", "right"],
      "intervals": [
        { "from": -1.4, "to": 1, "tone": "up", "label": "x ≤ 1" }
      ],
      "markers": [{ "x": 0.5, "name": "f(1/2)", "tone": "neutral" }],
      "guides": [
        { "x": 1, "label": "分界 x = 1" },
        { "y": -0.75, "label": "y = -3/4" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "answer",
      "title": "得到答案",
      "caption": "所以 f(f(3)) = f(1/2) = -3/4，选 B。A 是把 x = 3 错代进左边得到的 8，D 是只算完内层的 1/2，C 不是这两次代入的结果。",
      "formula": ["f(f(3))=-\\dfrac{3}{4}", "\\text{故选 B}"],
      "curve": "left",
      "curves": ["left", "right"],
      "intervals": [
        { "from": -1.4, "to": 1, "tone": "up", "label": "x ≤ 1" }
      ],
      "markers": [{ "x": 0.5, "name": "-3/4", "tone": "neutral" }],
      "guides": [
        { "x": 1, "label": "分界 x = 1" },
        { "y": -0.75, "label": "y = -3/4" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
